# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Crypto Advanced Signal Scanner – Environment
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in any required values.
# Most features work out-of-the-box with no secrets.

# ── General ──────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development

# ── Binance (Public API – No Key Required) ───
# Spot:   https://data-api.binance.vision / https://api.binance.com
# Futures: https://fapi.binance.com
# These are public endpoints and do NOT require API keys.

# ── CoinGecko (Fallback Provider) ───────────
# Free tier works without a key.
# For higher rate-limits, set your API key below:
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# ── PostgreSQL (ONLY for legacy template, NOT used) ──
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app_db